From: Nixpkgs contributors <nixpkgs@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] clang: retain query-only handling for SSAF listings

LLVM 23 adds immediate SSAF listing actions. Keep their native predicates and
combined-option behavior, returning query metadata before their output effects.

Assisted-by: Codex

--- a/lib/Driver/Driver.cpp
+++ b/lib/Driver/Driver.cpp
@@ -2602,3 +2602,4 @@
   if (ListExtractors || ListFormats) {
+    if (PrimaryQueryFD) return false;
     if (ListExtractors)
       ssaf::printAvailableTUSummaryExtractors(llvm::outs());
@@ -2610,3 +2611,4 @@
   if (C.getArgs().hasArg(options::OPT__ssaf_list_formats)) {
+    if (PrimaryQueryFD) return false;
     ssaf::printAvailableFormats(llvm::outs());
     return false;
